      "heading": "B — Audience, level and prerequisites: traffic signals",
      "learner_facing": false,
      "markdown": "## B — Audience, level and prerequisites: traffic signals\nAudience: first-time North Carolina applicants preparing for the regular Class C knowledge test, in English; the right-on-red rule [A01] and the dark-signal and flashing-signal rules [A02] are frequent recall items.\nLevel: display-to-action recall with legal yield duties; signal images suit picture flashcards for each display.\nPrerequisites: the right-of-way and intersection rules taught in the passing and intersections section, and the pedestrian rules in the pedestrians section.\nSensitivity: none beyond stating each display's meaning exactly as printed.\n",
